{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33711","headline":"句 · 张孜","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"着牙卖朱紫，断钱赊举选。\n华山秀作英雄骨，黄河泻出纵横才。\n梦破青霄春，烟霞无去尘。\n若夸郭璞五色笔，江淹却是寻常人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张孜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33711.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33711","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}